ons of domestic and foreign policy', Presidential Decree No. 586 dated June 22 of this year, in order to support the development of the financial sector, full coverage of digital networks of financial services, provision of various services, the following is implemented in non-cash settlements: payment of taxes, state duties, licenses, insurance, utilities, bank settlements.\",\n    \"newsText3\": \"The first Financial Literacy Festival from the National Bank of Tajikistan\",\n    \"newsText4\": \"We held a competition, gave out gifts and even hired\",\n    \"newsText5\": \"Looking for a job? There is a job!\",\n    \"newsText6\": \"We participated in the Career Festival as part of the International Youth Forum at the National Library.\",\n    \"newsText7\": \"Read more\",\n    \"calctext1\": \"Credit Calculator\",\n    \"calctext2\": \"Calculate the estimated loan terms\",\n    \"calctext3\": \"Loan amount\",\n    \"calctext4\": \"Interest rate % per year\",\n    \"calctext5\": \"Terms of the loan\",\n    \"calctext6\": \"Monthly payment\",\n    \"calctext7\": \"Full cost of the loan\",\n    \"calctext8\": \"Total percent\",\n    \"calctext9\": \"Payments details\",\n    \"footerText1\": \"For consumer\",\n    \"footerText2\": \"Cards\",\n    \"footerText3\": \"Express Card\",\n    \"footerText4\": \"Name card\",\n    \"footerText5\": \"Co-branded card\",\n    \"footerText6\": \"Kids cards\",\n    \"footerText7\": \"Credits\",\n    \"footerText8\": \"Credit - Dastras\",\n    \"footerText9\": \"Car loan\",\n    \"footerText10\": \"Mortgage\",\n    \"footerText11\": \"Goods in installments\",\n    \"footerText12\": \"Consumer credit\",\n    \"footerText13\": \"Credit Pawnshop\",\n    \"footerText14\": \"Credit calculator\",\n    \"footerText15\": \"Money transfers\",\n    \"footerText16\": \"Transfers from Russia\",\n    \"footerText76\": \"Transfers to Russia\",\n    \"footerText77\": \"Transfers to China\",\n    \"footerText18\": \"Contact\",\n    \"footerText19\":