",\\\"depth\\\":0,\\\"inlineStyleRanges\\\":[],\\\"entityRanges\\\":[],\\\"data\\\":{}}],\\\"entityMap\\\":{}}}\",\"content_en\":\"{\\\"contentStateen\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"9ls3f\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\" CJSC \\\\\\\"Development Bank of Tajikistan\\\\\\\" \\u2014 As part of its professional development and staff training programs, the Compliance Service conducted a specialized seminar titled \\\\\\\"The Concept of Compliance in the Banking System.\\\\\\\" The event was attended by representatives from the operational, legal, financial, and compliance departments. \\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"unstyled\\\",\\\"depth\\\":0,\\\"inlineStyleRanges\\\":[],\\\"entityRanges\\\":[],\\\"data\\\":{}},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"649jm\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The primary objective of the seminar was to enhance participants' knowledge regarding the role of compliance in banking operations and to strengthen the corporate culture of regulatory adherence. During the program, \\\\\\\"compliance\\\\\\\" was defined as a system of oversight and alignment of bank activities with legal requirements and international standards. \\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"unstyled\\\",\\\"depth\\\":0,\\\"inlineStyleRanges\\\":[],\\\"entityRanges\\\":[],\\\"data\\\":{}},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"6kf9u\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Experts emphasized that compliance is a vital tool for mitigating legal and financial risks while simultaneously bolstering customer confidence in financial institutions. The seminar specifically addressed issues related to KYC\\/AML (Know Your Customer \\/ Anti-Money Laundering) procedures, risk analysis, and internal audit protocols. \\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"unstyled\\\",\\\"depth\\\":0,\\\"inlineStyleRanges\\\":[],\\\"entityRanges\\\":[],\\\"data\\\":{}},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"8im1v\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"At the conclusion of the event, participants shared their practical experiences and underscored the necessity of implementing regular training programs to ensure the continuous professional growth of the staff. \\\",\\