mentNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">📣 ООО Банк &laquo;Арванд&raquo; объявляет тендер!</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">☀️ Тендер на закупку солнечного электрооборудования.</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">📌&nbsp; Тендерную документацию со всеми подробностями можно получить в Головном офисе по адресу: г. </span></span><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Худжанд, проспект Исмоила Сомони 1А или на сайте Банка (https://arvand.tj).</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">⌛️Крайний срок подачи тендерной документации: 03.11.2026 г.</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">📞 Телефон для связи: +992 92 777 35 02.</span></span></p>\",\"description_tg\":\"<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">📣 ҶСП Бонки &laquo;Арванд&raquo; тендер эълон менамояд!</span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">☀️ Тендер оид ба харидорӣ намудани таҷҳизотҳои барқдиҳандаи офтобӣ.</span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">📌 Ҳуҷҷатҳои тендериро бо ҳамаи тафсилот аз Саридора, дар суроғаи: ш. Хуҷанд, хиёбони Исмоили Сомонӣ 1А ё аз сомонаи Бонк ( https://arvand.tj ) дастрас намуда метавонед.</span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">⌛️Мӯҳлати ниҳоии супоридани ҳуҷҷатҳо барои тендер: 03.11.2026с.</span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">📞 Телефон барои тамос: +992 92 777 35 02.</span></p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">📣 Arvand Bank LLC announces a tender!</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">☀️ Tender for the procurement of solar electrical equipment.</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">📌&nbsp; The tender documentation with all the details can be obtained at the Head Office at: 1A Ismoili Somoni Avenue, Khujand, or on the Bank's website (https://arvand.tj).</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">⌛️Deadline for submission of tender documentation: 03/11/2026.</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lg:[[data-style-disabled=&quot;false&quot;]_&amp;]:textStyle_body.sm\\\"><span class=\\\"knownFragmentElementNode\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">📞 Contact phone number: +992 92 777 35 02.</span></span></p>\",\"created_at\":\"29.10.2026\",\"updated_at\":\"29.10.2026\",\"lft\":1,\"rght\":2,\"tree_id\":63,\"level\":0,\"parent\":null},{\"id\":148,\"pr_img\":\"/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/59/fd/59fdcb09-ccbd-44e3-8015-34ff9cc1395f/.png__400x400_ALIAS-pr_card_img_crop_subsampling-2_upscale.png\",\"documents\":[],\"news_types\":[],\"url\":\"/tg/pr/news/148/\",\"date\":\"23.10.2026\",\"backdating_at\":\"22.10.2026\",\"title\":\"Эълон оиди агенти бонкӣ!\",\"title_ru\":\"Объявление о банковском агенте!\",\"title_tg\":\"Эълон оиди агенти бонкӣ!\",\"title_en\":null,\"description\":\"<p><strong>Мизоҷони мӯҳтарам!</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Ба маълумоти Шумо мерасонем, ки шахсоне дар поён зикрг гардида эътиборан хизматрасониҳои бонкиро <strong>анҷом намедиҳад</strong> ва агенти бонкии ҶСП Бонки \\\"Арванд\\\" намебошанд:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"description_ru\":\"<p><strong>Уважаемые клиенты!</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Информируем вас о том, что нижеприведенные лица <strong>более не</strong> предоставляют банковские услуги и не являются банковскими агентоми ЗАО Банка \\\"Арванд\\\":</p>\\r\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 79%; height: 325px; background-color: #ecf0f1; border-color: #000000; border-style: dashed;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\">\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 22.4px; border-color: #000000;\\\">\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 4.08668%; height: 22.4px;\\\">&nbsp;</td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 38.1106%; height: 22.4px; text-align: center;\\\"><strong style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">ФИО</strong></td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.541%; height: 22.4px; text-align: center;\\\"><strong style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Регион</strong></td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 43.2427%; height: 22.4px; text-align: center;\\\"><strong style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Адрес</strong></td>\\r\\n</tr>\\r\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 22.4px;\\\">\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 4.08668%; height: 22.4px; text-align: center;\\\"><strong>1</strong></td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 38.1106%; height: 22.4px;\\\">Урокова Шоира Точиддиновна</td>\\r\\n<td style=\\\"width: 14.